        <mxCell id="close-c26" value="&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; closeMenuOnDismiss = false: scrim hiện lại, menu vẫn mở · true: menu = spring(0) → nút +" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="836" y="416" width="560" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
